Say one is stuck on a deserted island with natives having no prior scientific knowledge, but are logical, what series of experiments and theories does one must state to create a chain of reasons to convince the natives of every chemistry facts one knows?

This chapter wishes to accomplish such task for chemistry involving a single atom, though arguably not chemical.

